OL,4,CEx-Reform councillor to deny sex       
OL,5,Coffence charges                        
OL,6,GA suspended Reform UK councillor       
OL,7,Gindicated he will deny multiple        
OL,8,Gcharges of rape and sexual abuse as he 
OL,9,Gappeared in court to face the          
OL,10,Gallegations for the first time.        
OL,12,FGeorge Madgwick, 37, a Portsmouth city 
OL,13,Fcouncillor, faces 35 charges,          
OL,14,Fincluding 12 counts of rape, two       
OL,15,Fcounts of sexual assault, two counts   
OL,16,Fof assault by penetration, two counts  
OL,17,Fof making and one count of             
OL,18,Fdistributing indecent images of a      
OL,19,Fchild, among other charges.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
