OL,4,CMachete attacker tackled in pizza      
OL,5,Ctakeaway                               
OL,6,GStaff at a pizza takeaway showed       
OL,7,G"immense courage" in tackling and      
OL,8,Gdisarming an machete-wielding          
OL,9,Gattacker, police have said.            
OL,11,FCCTV footage from Pizzarella in        
OL,12,FTurbary Road, Ferndown, Dorset showed  
OL,13,Fthe moment Alexander Livick, 41,       
OL,14,Fwalked behind the counter and          
OL,15,Fthreatened staff late on 22 June.      
OL,17,FHe was restrained and disarmed by two  
OL,18,Fworkers and was later arrested by a    
OL,19,Fpolice dog unit.                       
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
